      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lakeside_Park%2C_Kentucky"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Kenton County commissioner Paul Hesser championed the first subdivisions and pushed for the incorporation of Lakeside Park.",
